==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|eo}} {{term|donner|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|la|eo}} {{term|donare|lang=la}}

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|don}}

# to [[give]]
#: ''La edzo '''donis''' al lia edzino perlan kolĉenon por Kristnasko.''
#: The husband '''gave''' his wife a pearl necklace for Christmas.

